Explain the stack full and stack empty conditions.

Ans: When stack is full top value is equal to max-1 and when it is empty top value is 0

Explain push() functions in C for stack using array. Ans: void push(stack *s,int x)
{

s->top=s->top+1; s->data[s->top]=x;
}

